  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 合作夥伴橫幅\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" />\n</p>\n\n## 📖 關於本模組\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VeqkaHjUMaE\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</p>\n\n**RPG 怪物等級系統**將 Minecraft 的戰鬥轉變為動態 RPG 體驗，讓每個怪物隨時間演進。\n\n取代靜態敵人的設計，怪物會隨著你的生存與探索升級——變得更強、更聰明、更危險。每一次遭遇都充滿新鮮感，將簡單的戰鬥化為有意義的挑戰。\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/nightbeamstudio\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## ✨ 特色\n\n- ⚔️ **動態怪物等級**  \n  怪物根據進度、時間、距離或環境動態成長\n\n- 📈 **屬性成長**  \n  生命值、傷害與技能隨等級提升\n\n- 🌍 **適應性難度**  \n  隨著探索進展，世界變得越來越困難\n\n- 🛡️ **領地系統**  \n  怪物在其區域內變得更強、更具攻擊性\n\n- ⚙️ **可設定進度**  \n  完全自訂的數值成長、上限與難度\n\n- 🎮 **真實 RPG 體驗**  \n  將生存轉變為以進度為基礎的戰鬥系統\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 支援與連結\n\n- 💬 **Discord：** https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK  \n- 💻 **GitHub：** https://github.com/MeherBenSalem  \n- 🔥 **CurseForge：** https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects  \n- 🌱 **Modrinth：** https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam  \n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n[bisect-banner]: https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\n[bisect-link]: https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam",
